# {{.Name}}

A LazyRex plugin, made with `lazyrex-hub plugin new {{.Name}}`.

- `main.lua`: the plugin. The guide is `docs/plugin-sdk.md` in LazyRex.
- `tests/{{.Name}}.lua`: its tests. Run them with `lazyrex-hub test` in this directory. Each run
  starts its own lab; it never touches your terminals.
- `lazyrex.json`: the manifest (the name, the main file, and the test agents).
